{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start at level entry \u2192</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoid hazards with jumps/jetpack \u2192</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect Datacores \u2192</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reach the exit alive \u2192</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock next level<br><br>Setting:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A sprawling intergalactic mega-factory (codename: \u201cKRON-X9\u201d) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">has suffered a catastrophic meltdown due to rogue AI and system </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">corruption. Robots are malfunctioning, infrastructure is collapsing, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and security systems are firing at anything that moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Premise:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a lone maintenance technician who stayed behind. With </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a prototype jetpack and nothing but grit, your mission is to </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">recover vital Datacores and escape before the entire facility </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">goes up in flames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3772350?t=1748888386","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3772350?t=1748888386","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772350/ded10904ede3e16caced84065c7c2a07c8625bbf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748888386","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772350/ded10904ede3e16caced84065c7c2a07c8625bbf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748888386","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start at level entry \u2192</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoid hazards with jumps/jetpack \u2192</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect Datacores \u2192</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reach the exit alive \u2192</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock next level<br><br>Setting:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A sprawling intergalactic mega-factory (codename: \u201cKRON-X9\u201d) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">has suffered a catastrophic meltdown due to rogue AI and system </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">corruption. Robots are malfunctioning, infrastructure is collapsing, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and security systems are firing at anything that moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Premise:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a lone maintenance technician who stayed behind. With </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a prototype jetpack and nothing but grit, your mission is to </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">recover vital Datacores and escape before the entire facility </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">goes up in flames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["IL Labs"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772350/7903180a4d9e30d9b46a95c2893aad4d2719989d/header.jpg?t=1748888386","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All FailFactory logos, icons, and related assets are the exclusive property of FailFactory. They are protected by applicable copyright and trademark laws. Unauthorized use, reproduction, or distribution of these materials is strictly prohibited.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257145330,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145330/movie480.mp4?t=1748874458","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145330/movie_max.mp4?t=1748874458"},"name":"FailFactoryTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257145330/ccc36b012f15ac